"domesticContext\":false,\"productTypes\":[\"Voucher\"],\"autoProductTypes\":[],\"products\":[],\"bonuses\":[],\"bonusEnginePromotions\":[],\"pricingVariants\":null,\"productsAvailability\":\"ProductsMayBeAvailable\",\"itemOrder\":1,\"preferredProductType\":null,\"productCategories\":[\"shopping\"],\"brandDescription\":\"👔 A Top Ten Mart e-gift card is the perfect way to surprise the men in your life — whether it’s your brother, father, husband, or a close friend. 🎁 With this e-gift card, they can shop ready-made garments and upgrade their wardrobe with timeless style.\",\"brandShortDescription\":\"Gift timeless style with an e-gift card for him 👞\",\"promoText\":null,\"expiry\":\"Valid for 6 months from the date of purchase.\",\"fees\":\"\",\"additionalTerms\":\"- This e-gift card is non-refundable, non-transferable, and cannot be exchanged for cash.\\n- Valid for one-time use only.\\n- Any remaining unused balance will be lost.\\n- Any extra cost beyond the e-gift card value must be paid by the customer.\",\"howToRedeem\":\"1. You’ll receive an e-gift card code and PIN number.\\n2. Share it with your loved one in Bangladesh.\\n3. They can redeem it by showing the e-gift card code and PIN number to the cashier at the Top Ten Mart store inside Unimart.\\n\\nThat’s it! Quick and simple 🎉\",\"contact\":\"**Support Hotline** 📞 +88 01765 900 999\",\"locations\":\"- Redeemable only at the **Top Ten Mart store inside Unimart** in Bangladesh.\\n- Valid only on ready-made garments.\\n- **Exclusions:** Not valid on President bags, cosmetics, special discount products, or tailoring services.\",\"seoMeta\":null,\"seoTitle\":null,\"banners\":[],\"productGroups\":[]},{\"fType\":\"Operator\",\"subject\":\"/api/operators/BD-3F16CF\",\"time\":1780430585,\"operatorCode\":\"3F16CF\",\"operatorId\":\"BD-3F16CF\",\"countryIso\":\"BD\",\"name\":\"Twitch\",\"accountRegex\":\"^(?:8800000000000|0000000000)$\",\"productsAreOmitted\":true,\"hasPinProducts\":false,\"hasAutoTopup\":false,\"dom